{
  "raw": "# Synthetic preparation\n## Disconnected bench\n\nOnly inside the isolated synthetic laboratory:\n\n- Complete both stages in order before releasing the inert fixture:\n  1. Seal the cobalt inlet.\n     - Example: keep the dummy gate closed.\n  2. Drain the violet chamber after sealing the inlet.\n     - Limitation: use only inert samples.\n  - Condition: never connect real equipment.\n- Caveat: do not restart before both stages finish.",
